  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_9752.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Motos y rockabilly han sido protagonistas la tarde y la noche, hasta la madrugada, de este s&aacute;bado 10 de mayo, en Onda, con la inauguraci&oacute;n del nuevo local de la asociaci&oacute;n Custom 100% Moteros, en la avenida del Mar de Monteblanco, y el concierto de Los Sidecares y Los Dalton en la nave de asociaci&oacute;n Rellamp.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gasamprollcustomondasidecareslosdaltonrellamp/img_9718.jpg\" alt=\"img_9718\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gasamprollcustomondasidecareslosdaltonrellamp/img_9719.jpg\" alt=\"img_9719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gasamprollcustomondasidecareslosdaltonrellamp/img_9720.jpg\" alt=\"img_9720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gasamprollcustomondasidecareslosdaltonrellamp/img_9721.jpg\" alt=\"img_9721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gasamprollcustomondasidecareslosdaltonrellamp/img_9722.jpg\" alt=\"img_9722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gasamprollcustomondasidecareslosdaltonrellamp/img_9723.jpg\" alt=\"img_9723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gasamprollcustomondasidecareslosdaltonrellamp/img_9724.jpg\" alt=\"img_9724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8